# Heavy knight sheet 2: 91x64, 7-wide. guard 0-6, lunge 7-13, swing 14-18.
# GandalfHardcore pack (licensed to the author, not redistributable on
# its own). The world view plays IDLE, or WALK when moving, and flips
# to face the heading. Action rows beyond idle/walk bake for later use.

sheet hknight2.ppm
cell 91 64

bank HKNIGHT2
seq GUARD loop ticks=4 : lin 0-6
seq LUNGE once ticks=2 : lin 7-13
seq SWING once ticks=2 : lin 14-18
